      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793982335829,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The flags are the address. PoolManager reads its low 14 bits: 0x…4aa0 & 0x3fff = 0x0aa0 · 0x…4b01 & 0x3fff = 0x0b01.\nSalts mined for the CREATE2 deployer 0x4e59…956c; each constructor reverts WrongHookAddress() if its bits differ.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2FSa4V8Qv_qRT_75oMFDt",
      "originalText": "The flags are the address. PoolManager reads its low 14 bits: 0x…4aa0 & 0x3fff = 0x0aa0 · 0x…4b01 & 0x3fff = 0x0b01.\nSalts mined for the CREATE2 deployer 0x4e59…956c; each constructor reverts WrongHookAddress() if its bits differ.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
